
Pheeder Account Deletion Policy

Pheeder respects your privacy and your right to request deletion of your account and associated personal data.

How to Request Account Deletion

To request deletion of your Blue Strip Valley account, email pheeder@gmail.com with the subject line Account Deletion Request.

Please include the email address associated with your account so we can identify your account and process your request.

Data Deletion

Once your request is verified and processed, your account and associated personal data will be deleted, except for information we are legally required or permitted to retain.

Contact Us

For account deletion requests or questions about this policy, contact:

Email: pheeder@gmail.com

Pheeder is intended for users aged 18 and older.

